SEL relays: settings are classified as SELOGIC equations, unused equations, settings, SER bit lists, or aliases for 300-, 400-, and 700-series relays. ``parsed-config.json`` gets ``logic_equations`` and ``logic_settings``, and ``logic.formats["selogic-equations"]`` gets a text listing of the equations, so equations are reported separately from timers and presets such as ``TDURD``, ``CFDX`` and ``PCN01PV := 500``, and labels such as ``RID := NOT USED`` stay settings.
